      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree.\n\nI also suggest an option menu such as following:\nWhen generating a new instance, the instance owner can choose the instance's safety option (limit of visible avatars).\nFor example, Avatars that have large particle, many materials, many polygons, etc looks blocked avatars.\nThis limit is applied for anyone who visits this instance.\n\nTherefore, visitors can distinguish between a calm(such as talking mainly) instance and a chaos(such as art performing) instance.\nWhen this safety settings are displayed on the instances' preview window, players can decide join or not easily.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
